  "description": "Sahwa had always wondered about his ‘origin’. Why did he dream of turning into a snake and slithering about whenever the full moon approached? Why did the lovers wrapped in the ‘ringed snake’—visible only to him—always end up dying? Mu-yeong, the being who had saved him as he fled from Maegu, seemed to hold the answers to all these questions.\n\n*“You’ve been waiting, haven’t you, Sahwa?”* *(Source: Bomtoon, translated)*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/bam_gori/)",
